        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Japanese haunted shrine mystery where a family's grudge becomes reality. Part 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was a mansion where ghostly phenomena frequently occurred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an exorcist, you set foot in the mansion to quell these supernatural disturbances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the spirits lurking within trap you inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to escape is to calm all the ghostly occurrences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with protective talismans to suppress the phenomena and candles to pacify the spirits, you begin your search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the moment you place a talisman, the spirits start to resist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not overlook any ghostly phenomena.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you find one, place a talisman and light the entrance candle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If no phenomena are present, light the candle without placing a talisman.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm all seven ghostly phenomena without making a single mistake.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return safely, no matter what.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About &quot;Reioku&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reioku is a horror game in the &quot;Exit 8 Like&quot; genre, where players must pacify all ghostly phenomena within the mansion and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Jumpscare-based &quot;Exit 8 Like&quot; horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Approximately 45–120 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: Keyboard &amp; Mouse (Controller not supported)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings: 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty: Low to Medium</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warnings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains sudden scares and loud noises. Do not play if you are under elementary school age or have a weak heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a child under elementary school age wishes to play, parental permission is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel unwell during gameplay, stop playing immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Anyone, including individuals, corporations, and groups, may stream the game without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Estimated streaming time: 60–150 minutes (may vary based on play style, difficulty, and probability-based events).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Monetization is only allowed for live or narrated gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Uploading raw gameplay footage without commentary for monetization is prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Mandatory]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You or your audience must purchase the game before streaming or reviewing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Include the word &quot;Reioku&quot; somewhere in your video title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Add the creator’s X account or the game’s store URL in the video description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Optional]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・If you enjoy the game, consider following the creator on X.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The creator is not responsible for any damages or issues caused by playing or streaming this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The game contains horror elements. Ensure you are in good physical condition before streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・These guidelines may be updated without notice.</p>",
